OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FDavid Walliams has been accused of
OL,8,Fpreying on girls as young as 15 after
OL,9,Fhe lost a court battle trying to block
OL,10,Fpublication of the allegations
OL,12,FIn a joint report from ITV News and the
OL,13,FGuardian, multiple women allege the
OL,14,Fcomedian and author used his celebrity
OL,15,Fstatus to prey on them for sexual
OL,16,Fpurposes when they were teenagers or
OL,17,Fyoung women
OL,19,FOne girl claims she was 15 when
OL,20,FWalliams first contacted her, and by
OL,21,Fthe time she was 17 they were having
OL,22,Fsex - he strongly denies he groomed her
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
