OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Metropolitan Police says it has
OL,8,Fcontacted the Guardian and ITV News so
OL,9,F"any potential victims" know how to
OL,10,Freport "any criminal allegations" - but
OL,11,Fit has not received any related reports
OL,12,Fof sexual assault or any other offences
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/20
