OL,3,A'Baffling but brilliant'
OL,4,Apost-apocalyptic novel The End of
OL,5,AEverything wins Booker Prize
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthor M John Harrison has become the
OL,8,Foldest ever winner of the Booker Prize,
OL,9,Fpicking up the prestigious literary
OL,10,Faward for his post-apocalyptic novel
OL,11,FThe End of Everything.
OL,13,FHarrison, 81, who has built a cult
OL,14,Ffollowing over his 60-year career, was
OL,15,Fnamed the winner of the #50,000 prize
OL,16,Fat a ceremony in London on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
